### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://68.221.71.45:8000
# @baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. GET All Measurements (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/list/
Accept: application/json

### 2. POST Normal Measurement (No Alert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/post/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 21.0,
  "humidity": 45.0
}

### 3. POST Alert Measurement (> 25°C -> Triggers Gmail & Telegram Alerts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/post/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 29.5,
  "humidity": 65.0
}

### 4. POST Critical Alert (32.0°C)
POST {{baseUrl}}/post/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "temperature": 32.0,
  "humidity": 70.0
}

### 5. GET Live Tailwind Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 6. GET History Table View
GET {{baseUrl}}/history/

### 7. Export CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/export-csv/
